        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer LB4333-400,  4\" x 4.215\" x 5/8\" Radius x Sq Corner Johnson Door Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSpecial door hinge size and hole location designed to fit preparation of door and frame manufactured by <b>Johnson Door</b>. Pivot point aligns with residential butt hinges gage .085 to .109\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEasily adjustable Spring Tension. UL Listed for fire door applications. Fits <b>Johnson Door  Frame</b>. Packaged with mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for  Bommer LB4333-400  Johnson Door Spring Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4.215\"</li>\r\n<li>Corner: 5/8\" Radius Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Corner: Square Corner Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .096\"</li>\r\n<li>Number of Holes: 8</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>BHMA <b>Certified Grade 1</b> for 1 million cycles.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed R-4667 653M</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Torque</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Special Hole Template - Johnson Door</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LB4333-400.pdf?v=1691094996\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer LB4333-400 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. None available.</b>\r\n</p>",
